# This is a browser-only app: it runs onnxruntime-web, never onnxruntime-node.
# onnxruntime-node (pulled in transitively by @huggingface/transformers) has a
# postinstall that downloads a CUDA/GPU runtime from nuget.org — dead weight here,
# and it makes `npm ci` hang/fail on networks that can't reach nuget. Skip it.
onnxruntime-node-install=skip
